join egg center
if {egg_intro} == false:
	set {egg_intro} = true
	egg: Hey!
	egg: Its me, the egg
	egg: Think you could help me out?
	egg: I need to get back with my dozen
	egg: Can you pick me up and take me to the top
else:
	if {egg_deaths} == 1.0:
		egg: Whoops, dropped me!
	elif {egg_deaths} == 2.0:
		egg: Mistakes happen, its cool
	elif {egg_deaths} == 3.0:
		egg: Please be careful man
	elif {egg_deaths} == 4.0:
		egg: Ain't no way
	elif {egg_deaths} == 5.0:
		egg: You have to stop dropping me
	elif {egg_deaths} == 6.0:
		egg: Maybe I can get someone else to help
	elif {egg_deaths} == 7.0:
		egg: You really can just leave me here
	elif {egg_deaths} == 8.0:
		egg: I think its fine just to be here, with my thoughts. you go on your own
	elif {egg_deaths} == 9.0:
		egg: Please, its not worth it man
	else:
		egg: No more, please